      "html": "<p>Scientific name: Chimarrichthys kishinouyei (Kimura, 1934). Synonyms: Coraglanis kishinouyei, Euchiloglanis kishinouyei, Exostoma kishinouyei. Family Sisoridae. Size: 148 mm SL. IUCN Red List: Not Evaluated.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1410",
      "html": "<p>Asia: Nepal and China. Upper Min-Jiang River, Yangtze River basin. Type locality: Yingxiu, Dujiangyan City [formerly Kwan-hsien, Szechwan Province], Sichuan Province, China.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "habitat",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1410",
      "html": "<p>Inhabits rocky and gravel bed pools in streams.</p>"
